config POSIX_DEVICE_SPECIFIC
	bool "POSIX terminal device interfaces"
	depends on POSIX_DEVICE_IO
	help
	  Select 'y' here and Zephyr will provide implementations of the
	  POSIX_DEVICE_SPECIFIC Option Group: the termios attribute and
	  line-control functions, ctermid(), isatty(), and ttyname(). The
	  console is the one terminal; attribute changes round-trip, and
	  the synchronous console driver completes drain, flush, flow, and
	  break operations trivially.
